# 4 slugs differ — 3 documented in REDIRECT_MAP.md, plus one it missed:
# /dario-giuffrida/ (commit cf5a15b renamed him to Dario Hampi Pacari; the
# map's "29 of 32 match" count is off by one because of it — actually 28).

RewriteRule ^jure-biechoniski/?$ https://transpersonal-training.com/teachers/#jure-biechonski [R=301,NE,L]
RewriteRule ^dr-ingo-benjamin-jahrsetz/?$ https://transpersonal-training.com/teachers/#ingo-jahrsetz [R=301,NE,L]
